# Services the «Проверка сервисов» button asks through one modem (no keys, no
# speed test).
# id|name|group|url|extra codes that mean «works»
# group: open — the open internet that works in Russia without a tunnel and goes under «белые списки»; known — blocked
# in Russia already (by the regulator, or the service refuses Russia itself): shown, never a sign of a whitelist (the
# owner, 2026-11-15: «это не признак белых списков, ведь и ркн и сам чатгпт блокирует»); list — expected to stay
# reachable under «белые списки».
# Any 2xx/3xx answer works; 403 and 451 are «blocked»; the extra codes are answers a service
# gives without credentials (401 of an API) and still prove it is reachable.
google|Google|open|https://www.google.com/generate_204|
github|GitHub|open|https://github.com/|
wikipedia|Wikipedia|open|https://ru.wikipedia.org/|
cloudflare|Cloudflare|open|https://www.cloudflare.com/cdn-cgi/trace|
microsoft|Microsoft|open|https://www.microsoft.com/|
telegram|Telegram|known|https://api.telegram.org/|404
youtube|YouTube|known|https://www.youtube.com/generate_204|
whatsapp|WhatsApp|known|https://web.whatsapp.com/|
discord|Discord|known|https://discord.com/api/v9/experiments|
claude|Claude|known|https://api.anthropic.com/v1/models|401
chatgpt|ChatGPT|known|https://api.openai.com/v1/models|401
yandex|Yandex|list|https://ya.ru/|
vk|VK|list|https://vk.com/|
wildberries|Wildberries|list|https://www.wildberries.ru/|498
# the mobile operators' own sites (the owner, 2026-10-31): they stay reachable under «белые списки»; their anti-bot
# front answers a script 403 or 429, still the site itself
mts|MTS|list|https://mts.ru/|403 429
t2|T2 (Tele2)|list|https://t2.ru/|403 429
megafon|MegaFon|list|https://megafon.ru/|403 429
beeline|Beeline|list|https://beeline.ru/|403 429
